- Initial package of xrt 202610.2.21.21
  Xilinx Runtime (XRT) provides runtime libraries and tools for
  programming and managing AMD/Xilinx FPGA accelerator cards. It
  supports OpenCL applications, device administration, accelerator
  image handling, kernel driver sources, and Python bindings.

